==[ Verify your installation ]

Check that `tomet` and `sisho` are available on your `PATH`:

```bash
`` tomet --version
```

```
`` tomet 0.5.0
```

```bash
`` sisho --version
```

```
`` sisho 0.1.0
```

```bash
`` sisho -l
```

```
`` desk      .../sisho-desk
```
